{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226928","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226928","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422692801:1":{"text":"平民，你怎敢反抗？难道不知道恩典灵露应当优先供应给贵族吗？","source_cn":"平民，你怎敢反抗？难道不知道恩典灵露应当优先供应给贵族吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFEE5F3C525F0E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422692802:1":{"text":"凭、凭什么！我的孩子同样需要灵露抵抗孽化！","source_cn":"凭、凭什么！我的孩子同样需要灵露抵抗孽化！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05776FBAC398A3AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422692803:1":{"text":"何、何况，现在大家都一样！你的贵族身份，不值钱了！","source_cn":"何、何况，现在大家都一样！你的贵族身份，不值钱了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51E718D18E2EC722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422692804:1":{"text":"愚蠢！只有高贵血脉才能正确使用灵露的力量！","source_cn":"愚蠢！只有高贵血脉才能正确使用灵露的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A9490F435C56ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422692805:1":{"text":"荒谬！灵露是为了抵御诅咒的影响，所有艾塞勒人都有资格获取。","source_cn":"荒谬！灵露是为了抵御诅咒的影响，所有艾塞勒人都有资格获取。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7287E530B9347059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_tit